# W1 live path: the Djinn-owned receipt host posts one real job before the
# browser joins its admitted Distillery Chronicle route over the WebRTC door.
# Chronicle card titles are post hashes, so the host receipt identifies the
# exact post; the page verifies Chronicle's supplied `Job` label and its
# one-card projection here.
wait
assert snap remote-link == webrtc
assert snap remote-state == open
assert snap remote-revision >= 2
assert snap remote-cards == 1
assert snap remote-card-labels ~ Job
act session-remote
settle 1
assert snap session == remote
assert snap remote-overlaps == 0
capture distillery_chronicle_live_w1_mounted
wait
log distillery Chronicle W1 live headed receipt complete
